{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "380a7de9-f932-458c-a17f-31f8f3bc4ccc",
    "name": "Nexa Clinic API",
    "description": "Koleksi lengkap REST API Sistem Informasi Klinik Nexa.\n\nCara pakai:\n1. Pastikan backend berjalan di http://localhost:5000.\n2. Jalankan request '1. Auth > Login (Administrator)' lebih dulu — token JWT otomatis tersimpan ke variable {{token}} dan dipakai semua request lain.\n3. Setiap request punya tab 'Tests' berisi pengujian otomatis (klik Send lalu lihat tab Test Results), atau jalankan seluruh koleksi lewat Collection Runner.\n\nBase URL memakai prefix /api → {{base_url}} = http://localhost:5000/api",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token_dokter",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token_petugas",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "nik",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "patient_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "poli_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
